 "in_use_summary_en": "No public sign of same-day X-ray reports or radiology-triggered CT in Pirkanmaa: Pirha's pathway (updated 19.8.2026) has the GP send an urgent referral, a lung specialist handle it in 1–2 working days, and CT usually done within a week after that.",
 "missing_en": "",
